    {
      "name": "add_account",
      "description": "Start OAuth 2.0 (PKCE) to authorize another X account. Returns authorize_url for the user to open in a browser logged in to that account, and a note to relay to them. mode=loopback: a local listener saves the token automatically; confirm with auth_status. mode=paste: ask the user to paste the callback URL from the address bar right after approving and pass it to complete_authorization at once. Tokens are stored only on this machine.",
